### ============================================================
###  MATCHMAKING – Spanish Poker Dice API
###  Base: http://localhost:8476/api
###
###  SETUP: Run "GET /api/users" first, copy two real userIds
###         into @user1 and @user2 below.
###
###  FLOW:
###    1. User 1 joins queue  → matched: false, position: 1
###    2. User 2 joins queue  → matched: true, game created (201)
###    3. View queue (admin)  → empty after a match
###
###  To test the leave route, re-run step 1 without step 2,
###  then hit DELETE /matchmaking/queue/{{user1}}.
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8476/api

# Replace with real userIds from GET /users
@user1 = 4904147198225416
@user2 = 6713352303982086


### 1. User 1 joins the queue (no match yet)
POST {{baseUrl}}/matchmaking/queue
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-role: registered

{
    "userId": {{user1}},
    "rules": {
        "bestof": 3,
        "straightallowed": true,
        "roundTime": 10
    }
}


### 2. User 2 joins the queue (should match with User 1 → returns game)
POST {{baseUrl}}/matchmaking/queue
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-role: registered

{
    "userId": {{user2}}
}


### 3. View the current queue (admin only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/matchmaking/queue
x-user-role: admin


### 4. Leave the queue before a match is found
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/matchmaking/queue/{{user1}}
x-user-role: registered


### 5. Try joining while already in queue (should 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/matchmaking/queue
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-role: registered

{
    "userId": {{user1}}
}


### 6. Try viewing queue as non-admin (should 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/matchmaking/queue
x-user-role: registered


### 7. Try joining without auth (should 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/matchmaking/queue
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": {{user1}}
}


### 8. Anonymous user 1 joins anonymous queue (no userId needed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/matchmaking/queue/anonymous
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "rules": {
        "bestof": 3,
        "straightallowed": true,
        "roundTime": 10
    }
}


### 9. Anonymous user 2 joins — should match with user 1 and return a game (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/matchmaking/queue/anonymous
Content-Type: application/json

{}
